nAdditionally, there's a restaurant in the Fenway area that serves rasam ramen, which you can order with fried chicken.\n\n## Student Deals in Fenway\n\nWhile specific ramen student discounts weren't highlighted, there are broader student deals available in the Fenway area:\n\n- Time Out Market is located in the Fenway area and offers student deals such as free fries, free hummus, and a free non-alcoholic beverage with college student verification\n\n- Tasty Burger offers the Starvin' Student Discount for $13, which includes a cheeseburger, fries, and a cold beer\n\n- Saloniki Greek provides free Greek fries with the purchase of any dish for students with valid student ID\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "052e27af-5422-47cd-8ee7-59a82da1beac", "uuid": "ed3141c3-72d5-4026-8263-443c30609aec", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T06:41:42.513Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Fenway ramen student deals", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01XQnx8JsLJpteUrJTcxec7Z", "content": [{"title": "Our Wildly Comprehensive Guide to Eating and Drinking in Fenway", "url": "https://www.bostonmagazine.com/restaurants/best-restaurants-fenway-neighborhood/"}, {"title": "I Tried Every Restaurant At Time Out Market Boston...", "url": "https://spoonuniversity.com/school/northeastern/i-tried-every-restaurant-at-time-out-market-boston/"}, {"title": "Discover Dining Deals & Hidden Gems in The Fenway.", "url": "https://thefenway.com/news/fenway-foodies-club/"}, {"title": "The Fenway Foodies Club football dining deals", "url": "https://thefenway.com/news/red-sox-student9s/"}, {"title": "The 11 best places to grab a bowl of ramen in Boston", "url": "https://www.timeout.com/boston/restaurants/best-ramen-in-boston"}, {"title": "Fenway Student Apartments | Boston Apartments Near Universities", "url": "https://thefenway.com/student-apartments/"}, {"title": "Colleges of the Fenway", "url": "